&_nc_oc=AdpRbiLgjpmXE87be4iMX8Adlchc_PAWWhwPuJu0gzs9LPEhH7e5Yrq6kXPYV2m8-bQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI7hK36GcT7ZppChRAtQVpXw4ZDVE7Sk_AUtrrncV0sGA&oe=6A9C323E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eg17JRYcDJcQ7kNvwGFngQ9&_nc_oc=Adpvhx4FYoOBpdWrP-QTiK3aSFCUfU5PhofNM-ZNwI4r7IJBd1KkQRPvEETFNNYIeUI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLWxTVY_5FbzDycjRhcQOpT1jE3I9lTy5w_nvwYl_XXjg&oe=6A9C433C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cIpe9Xo_dz0Q7kNvwGVlbyW&_nc_oc=AdprN-qgGqfxPExqvhnXahlTzi0EC4vEisdQoBqQ6SLnhioysKrbNeruLP7mg7pXg-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIwkr-iY3UUEGNS7K3y5PCfhurhI_7jFrLTai7GCeMjXg&oe=6A9C2987"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rf_UZ6HJwWwQ7kNvwHHTHKR&_nc_oc=AdqMDnoR0Yo-NswJrKOzDJifIYUTLQHwsJbv17ZHX7nthiRVdM9dQV-fOUJnbyNnAZg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI4s-O7q6ar15J9JhasO9NqrcxmJe6pY6Vu3w5Wco1erA&oe=6A9C1555"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UROjQkqgNMYQ7kNvwGSNB95&_nc_oc=AdoWq2DYqS-TLiwufxjt-h4HgTpLszE2ASsR37LUb5e8XGeSNn63YJhGjCeoM-cHkF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKS45dnFT1hgWvDyC87JM8i2fUF0g8N_LctwvjeNavxaQ&oe=6A9C21E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.